// // This shader uses the old lighting architecture that relied on global
// // properties declared in UILighting.cginc. Those properties have been removed
// // to enforce a pure function library architecture.
// //
// // MIGRATION: Use SDFKnob.shader instead, which follows the new pattern.
// //
// // This shader will not compile. To temporarily re-enable it, you must:
// // 1. Declare the required properties in the CGPROGRAM section:
// //    float3 _LightDirection; float _LightIntensity; float4 _LightColor;
// //    float _LightingAmbient; float _SpecularPower; float _SpecularIntensity;
// //    float _BevelDepth; float _BevelSmoothness;
// // 2. Update calls to calculateLighting() and apply3DLighting() to pass these
// //    as explicit parameters (see ApplyUILighting() for the modern pattern).
// // ============================================================================

